		{"id":"c1b5d98fd6bd9060","type":"text","text":"Treated Telephone relays as 1 [ closed circuit ] and 0 for [ open circuit ]. The conclusion being - Boolean Algebra is applicable to these relay circuits.","x":833,"y":400,"width":360,"height":191},
